type: software
title: "Reproducibility package: How Close to Optimal? Benchmarking a Hybrid Heuristic for Balanced Bipartition with Positional Correspondence"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and raw per-run results behind every table and figure in the
  CACIC 2026 paper on balanced bipartition with positional correspondence,
  including the exact optimum baseline via Edmonds' Blossom algorithm.
